    {
      "id": 256884,
      "name": "Wilko van den Bergh",
      "username": "Wilko",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/a9a28c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2024-02-16T17:03:02.283Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Unfortunately, emailing them brings nothing new either: The latest news was that the container with the expansion “has been scheduled” to be shipped to Europe, and that the VAT paperwork was dealt with. They also posted on the Backerkit forum:“This will be our last BackerKit update for Nature Incarnate, since fulfillment is done, other than in the EU. All future communication with EU backers will be done via email, so as not to spam those outside the region”.</p>\n<p>So that will likely mean no news for quite some time, until that container finally ends up in Poland and they can start sending the game to EU backers… Disappointing!</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2024-02-16T17:03:02.283Z",
